The experiments were implemented using Pytorch. To eval-
uate the proposed method, similar to [19], we adopted the
leave-one-out cross-validation strategy where one pair of
3T-7T data is used for testing and the remaining 9 pairs
for supervised training. All 15 unpaired 3T data was used
for consistency learning.



